        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu tshidimu tshinai tshia bukokeshi bua mukelenge Dayawesha, dî dia Yehowa diakalua kudi Zekâya mu dituku dinai dia ngondo wa tshitema, ngondo wa Kiseleu mene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ba mu Betele bakadianjila kutuma Shalesê ne Legeme-meleke ne bantu babo bua kulombabo diakalengele kudi Yehowa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bua kukonka bakuidi ba mu nsubu wa Yehowa wa misumba ne baprofete bandi ne, Ndi mua kuasa madilu ne kujila bia kudia mu ngondo muitanu bu munakumana kuenza bidimu ebi bia bungi, anyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dî dia Yehowa wa misumba diakalua kundi ne, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akula ne bantu bonso ba mu buloba ebu, ne bakuidi kabidi, ubambile ne, Hanuakajila bia kudia ne hanuakasa muadi mu ngondo muitanu ne mu ngondo wa muanda mutekete mu bidimu ebi makumi muanda mutekete, nuakajila bia kudia bua bualu buanyi mene, anyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuadia ne hanuanua, kanuena nudia, kanuena nunua anu bua kudisankisha, anyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanuakunvua mei akamba Yehowa mukana mua baprofete ba diambedi, hakadi Yelushalema ne bantu ne diakalengele, ne hakadi misoko numunyunguluke, ne hakadi bantu bashikame mu buloba ku Sude ne mu tshibanda, anyi?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.7.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe, dî dia Yehowa diakalua kudi Zekâya ne, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehowa wa misumba wakamba ne, Kosai bilumbu ne dikosa dia bushuwa, leshanganai dinanga ne nufuilangane luse, muntu ne muntu ne mukuabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanukengeshi bakashi ba mu lufuila, anyi bana ba nshiya, anyi muenyi, anyi bahele; muntu kahangidishi bualu mu mutshima wandi bua kuenzela muanʼabo bibi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi bobo bakabenga kungunvuila, bakasaka makaya, bakajibika matshu abo bua bobo kabunvu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyo, bakavuisha mitshima yabo bu dibue dia diamant, bua kabunvu diyisha dia mikenji ne mei akadi Yehowa wa misumba mubatumine ku bukole bua Nyuma wandi mukana mua baprofete ba diambedi. Nunku tshiji tshikole tshia Yehowa wa misumba tshiakaha kudibo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe, Yehowa wa misumba wakamba ne, Nakababikila, kadi bobo kabakangunvuila. Nunku bobo nebadile kundi, ne tshiena mbunvuila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakabatangadisha mu nvunde munkatshi mua bisamba bionso biakadibo kabayi banze kumanya. Nunku buloba buakumukabo buakabutudibua ku nyima kuabo, kakuakadi muntu wakayamu anyi wakafumamu; buloba buakadi busankisha mitshima ya bantu buakakudimuka tshikulu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.7.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
